{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act53side_level_act53side_05_beg","storyGroup":"act53side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act53side_level_act53side_04_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TO-5","storyName":"勇敢的短耳朵","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"情况紧急，太阳谷工业同意让阿梅利亚维修通讯塔。在远程通讯的帮助下，塔妮成功从井下将人救了上来。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act53side/level_act53side_05_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act53side_05","minState":"UNLOCKED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["严肃的负责人","安洁莉娜","健硕的矿工","阿梅利亚","太阳谷联络员","塔妮","强壮的矿工","嘉辛塔","安洁莉娜的声音","乱糟糟的声音","太阳谷维修员","伊娜拉","“记忆中的短耳朵”","小塔妮","救援人员的声音"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_bg_offce.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"K3号管线井疑似塌方，井下连接中断，两人被困......","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"那口管线井正好在采矿沉陷区，几年前还做过补强，按说不应该出事故。","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"但现在全雷姆必拓的源石矿都在增产，怕不是哪个混蛋被钱迷了眼，把附近的支撑用矿柱给凿了，才会出这种事......","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"算了，追责是之后的事。现在救人要紧。管线井先出问题也总比采空区出问题要好点。","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":15},{"type":"text","text":"负责人重重叹了口气，目光从三人脸上挨个扫过去。","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"我知道卡特斯天生就不把下井和钻洞当回事，这次事故的起因也跟塔妮小姐没关系，但她现在毕竟是被困了。","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"作为她的朋友，你们几位的来头一个比一个大，你们倒是说说，现在想怎么办？","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$2","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"太阳谷不追究我们的责任就已经是万幸了，我想罗德岛、坎贝尔家和纵贯红土公司更不会反过来追究别的事情。","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"至于怎么办......","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"经阿梅利亚的改造，我们四人的终端都能接入远程通讯系统，而我听矿工说过，通讯塔特地为矿井做过信号增强——","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"请允许阿梅利亚小姐现在就去维修通讯塔，这样就可以联系上被困的人了！","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"......行吧。我叫几个人来给你们带路。","id":26},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":29},{"type":"charslot","id":30},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","posfrom":"-180,0","posto":"-180,0","duration":"1.5","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","posfrom":"180,0","posto":"180,0","duration":"1.5","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":35},{"type":"charslot","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"健硕的矿工","text":"巴顿先生，情况我们都听说了。","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"好，那我不用解释了。","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"健硕的矿工","text":"哪位是来维修的工程总监？","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#11$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"是我——","id":45},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"-50,0","duration":"0.8","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.8","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#15$1","action":"jump","posto":"0,140","power":"80","times":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.8","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#15$1","posfrom":"0,140","posto":"200,140","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"——呜啊，我我我自己会跑，别把我扛在肩膀上跑，我我我我恐高啊！","id":59},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"charslot","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#24$2","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.2","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.2","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1.3","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#4$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"（高声）——还要帮什么忙都可以来找我啊，几位小姐！","id":68},{"type":"dialog","id":69},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_46_g6_rmbtmine.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#14$3","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"呼——呼——别紧张，别紧张塔妮！只是前面的路塌方了，你没有事，你没有受伤！","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$3","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我我我现在应该做什么？对，先联系安洁莉娜，她在上面会通知其他人，帮忙想办法的！","id":80},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"charslot","id":82},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#11$3","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"怎么办怎么办，怎么会在这个时候坏掉？啊啊，还有那个维修工，她肯定被困在下面了！","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stompfeet","volume":"1","id":89},{"type":"text","text":"塔妮一急，又忍不住开始跺起脚来。","id":90},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pawfootstep_1","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":91},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":92},{"type":"text","text":"安静的地下通道中原本只有她自己一个人的声音，此刻呼应着她的跺脚声，一阵凌乱的声音从地下隐隐地传来。","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$3","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"——等一下，我好像听到了什么声音......？","id":95},{"type":"dialog","id":96},{"type":"charslot","id":97},{"type":"text","text":"咚咚、咚、咚咚咚！","id":98},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#4$3","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"好像是跺脚的声音......很混乱，很慌张......","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$3","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"是那个维修员发出来的吗......？","id":103},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"text","text":"塔妮站在漆黑一片的通道里有些紧张。","id":106},{"type":"text","text":"她忍不住开始想，如果是奶奶在这里，奶奶会怎么做？","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#14$3","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"奶奶一定会用她超级厉害的源石技艺一下子就打开一条道路，把人救出来！可我不像奶奶这么厉害，我什么都不会......","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$3","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我浑身上下只有耳朵像奶奶......欸，耳朵？","id":111},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pawfootstep_1","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":114},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":115},{"type":"text","text":"咚咚、咚、咚咚咚！","id":116},{"type":"text","text":"隐隐传来的跺脚声像是催促，又像是鼓励。","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"塔妮猛地竖起耳朵，认真分辨着声音传来的方位。","id":118},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#4$3","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"......“那个小卡特斯和你一样，喜欢跺脚，可她没有学会求救的信号要怎么跺，只好急急忙忙乱跺一通”......","id":121},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"“奶奶把耳朵贴在地上，听到了这个声音，就知道有一个像你一样的小卡特斯困在下面啦。”——那个人一个人在下面一定很害怕！","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#14$3","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"虽然我、我也很害怕......但我从家里跑出来，不就是一直想做到点什么吗？","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我的背包可以保护我，我的听力很好，现在没有通讯，但说不定我能找到她在哪里！","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$3","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"塔妮，相信自己，你有能力做到点什么的！","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"你、你可以先去找到那个维修员，让她不要那么害怕！","id":129},{"type":"dialog","id":130},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$3","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":133},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_bg_bg_lungmencommand.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":139},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"健硕的矿工","text":"要工具箱是吗？给！","id":144},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","id":146},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"强壮的矿工","text":"够不到上面的螺丝？我来！","id":149},{"type":"dialog","id":150},{"type":"charslot","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"主柱无裂缝和弯曲，天线安装牢固，避雷接地的电阻值在规定范围内......","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#11$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"快一点，我得再快一点——","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"这次绝对不能出错......！","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"阿梅利亚手脚麻利地操作着，时间一分一秒地过去。","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"好，新的通讯核心更换好了！","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"太好了阿梅！","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2353_1#1$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的负责人","text":"好，我已经把消息告诉了负责救援的矿工，他们已经在试图进入管线井了。","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"只是通讯效果还没有经过测试，可能不太稳定......","id":167},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"塔妮，塔妮，拜托了，快接通讯......","id":173},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_46_g6_rmbtmine.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":186},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":187,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$3","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"奇怪，这里怎么有这么多岔路......？","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#4$3","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"声音是从这里传来的，没错，顺着这条路下去应该就是维修员小姐所在的地方！","id":191},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$3","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-120,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"2","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$3","posfrom":"-120,0","posto":"-40,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$3","posfrom":"-40,0","posto":"40,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":197},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"60","isblock":"true","duration":"0.2","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$3","posfrom":"40,0","posto":"40,-30","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.3","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"欸？这里怎么有个坑......","id":202},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"jump","posfrom":"40,-30","posto":"50,30","power":"100","times":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.6","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":206},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":207},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_square_common","char":" ","switch":"true","style":"1","offset":"-450,125","channel":"3","id":208},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","duration":"0","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜的声音","text":"——滋滋啦啦......塔妮！......你......哪里？","id":210},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"安洁莉娜？","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":214},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜的声音","text":"是我！塔妮，你怎么样？","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乱糟糟的声音","text":"......打通了？快让她回来，下面岔路很多......","id":217},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"——回去？不行，我——","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":221},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乱糟糟的声音","text":"等等，扫描上看......她走的路是对的！......","id":223},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嘿嘿，对吧！","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":227},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乱糟糟的声音","text":"只需要再往下......你让她再往下走，遇到岔路左转，就能找到那个维修员了......！","id":229},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$3","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"往下，左转......","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":233},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜的声音","text":"塔妮你听到了吗？我就在上面等你......还有嘉辛塔——还有阿梅！","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜的声音","text":"管线井的应急出口也都清理好了确保绝对安全，医疗人员和救援人员也都已经到了！","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜的声音","text":"加油加油！我们相信你一定能做到的！","id":237},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嗯！","id":240},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":242},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"charslot","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pawfootstep_1","id":250},{"type":"text","text":"咚咚咚，咚，咚咚！","id":251},{"type":"text","text":"像是听到了上方传来的声音，下面的跺脚声突然加快了速度。","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","posfrom":"40,0","posto":"40,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"找到了，就是这里了！","id":254},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"唔，好小的缝隙——还好还好，我挤得进去！","id":259},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":260},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.35","fillto":"0.35","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":265},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.35","fillto":"0.35","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_50_g17_wunderpass.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":268},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":269},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":271},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":272,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"唉，好像上面又没有声音了，果然，刚才应该就只是坍塌的声音......","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"通讯断了，胳膊的状况好像也有点严重，我还是老老实实等待救援吧，说不定还能被发现......","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"唉，这次还会有人像小时候那样把我救出去吗......？","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"那个又温柔又帅气的奶奶......","id":276},{"type":"dialog","id":277},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":280},{"type":"charslot","id":281},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.35","fillto":"0.01","fadetime":"0","id":282},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.35","fillto":"0.01","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":283},{"type":"curtain","id":284},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":285},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":286},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"啊，找到你了，没有学会跺求救信号的孩子。","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#1$1","id":293},{"type":"multiline","name":"伊娜拉","text":"让我看看，你是怎么一个人跑到这么深的地方来的呢？","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#3$1","id":295},{"type":"multiline","name":"伊娜拉","text":"......喔，你挖了这么长的一个洞啊。","id":296},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-30","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.2","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"charslot","id":301},{"type":"text","text":"伊娜拉伸出手摸了摸眼前这个浑身是泥的小卡特斯，手掌上粗糙的茧蹭得她忍不住又哭了起来。","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#14$1","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,-30","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"这么小的年纪就能挖出来这么长的一个洞，你很厉害呢。","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"好了，趴到我的背上吧，我带你出去。","id":305},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"charslot","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"小卡特斯在伊娜拉的背上扭来扭去，一把抓住了伊娜拉的耳朵，像是终于安心下来了一样，不再抽抽噎噎。","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#8$1","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,-30","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"哈哈，也好，那你就抓紧点，别掉下去！","id":310},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":311},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.35","fillto":"0.35","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":317},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.35","fillto":"0.35","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"那双短短的又毛茸茸的耳朵......","id":323},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"50_g17_wunderpass","duration":"0.3","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.25","yScaleTo":"1.25","block":"false","id":325},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.35","fillto":"0.25","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.3","id":326},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.35","fillto":"0.25","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":327},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bubble_cartoon_2","volume":"1","id":328},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_5","style":"cg","sfrom":"0.5","sto":"1","sduration":"0.3","layer":"1","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":330},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_inspiration","volume":"1","id":331},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_emoji_proud","layer":"2","x":"90","y":"-30","id":332},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_5","id":333},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_7","style":"cg","layer":"1","id":334},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":335},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_7","id":336},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_5","style":"cg","layer":"1","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":338},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_5","id":339},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_7","style":"cg","layer":"1","id":340},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":341},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_7","id":342},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_5","style":"cg","layer":"1","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":344},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$holiday_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_holiday_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":345,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"我、我好像又看到了那双耳朵......真的是一模一样啊......","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“记忆中的短耳朵”","text":"啊，找到你了，没有学会跺求救信号的维修员小姐！","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"我是已经疼晕过去了在做梦吗......怎么连、连说的话都一样......！","id":348},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bubble_cartoon_1","volume":"1","id":350},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_5","style":"cg","sfrom":"1","sto":"0.3","sduration":"0.3","pfrom":"0,0","pto":"0,100","pduration":"0.3","layer":"1","id":351},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":352},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_5","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“记忆中的短耳朵”","text":"嘿嘿，来，我找到出去的路了，跟着我走吧！","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"——欸？","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$3","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“记忆中的短耳朵”","text":"等等，你不是维修员吗？这个大电钻是什么......？","id":359},{"type":"charslot","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"是......是我的幸运物品啦......","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$3","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“记忆中的短耳朵”","text":"让我看看......你的手臂被压住了，但是......还好，有可以撬动的空间......","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“记忆中的短耳朵”","text":"我会试着把土石撬起来！","id":365},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":366},{"type":"dialog","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":370},{"type":"charslot","id":371},{"type":"curtain","id":372},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_46_g6_rmbtmine.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":376},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":377,"musicid":4},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$3","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"80,0","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$3","focus":"l","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"呼......呼......","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"嘶......我们走、走到哪里了？","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","focus":"l","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"就快了！维修员小姐，我们只需要沿着这条路往上走，一定能出去的！","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"好......","id":389},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"charslot","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#14$3","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"80,0","focus":"l","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"呼......呼......","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"我好困......是井下缺氧了吗？我们会不会......","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#11$3","focus":"l","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"不、不会的！我比你矮，我都没有问题，不会是缺氧的！","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"我们能......不走了吗？我太累了，而且好害怕，这里好黑......","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$3","focus":"l","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"不能半途而废呀！你要是觉得累，就搭在我肩膀上吧！","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"我不想拖累你......","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","focus":"l","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"这不是拖累，而且......而且我们会成功的！这只是一次轻微的塌方——","id":408},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"charslot","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"塔妮忽然想起自己年幼时的事情。","id":411},{"type":"text","text":"那时的自己也和身边的人一样，又累、又痛、又害怕。","id":412},{"type":"text","text":"那时的奶奶是怎么做的呢？","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$3","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"80,0","focus":"l","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"奶奶......她给我讲了个故事。","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"......故事？","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","focus":"l","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"对，故事。","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","focus":"l","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我来给你讲故事吧。只要有故事、有同伴，再远的路程，也只要几个故事的时间就能走完了！","id":422},{"type":"dialog","id":423},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":424},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":425},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":426},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_65_g9_warmrabbitnest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":427},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":428},{"type":"charslot","id":429},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":430},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小塔妮","text":"呜呜——奶奶，我的耳朵好痛！","id":432},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#1$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"因为你的耳朵上又缠住带刺草果了。来，我帮你解开。","id":434},{"type":"charslot","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小塔妮","text":"不要不要不要，很痛！","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#1$1","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"不解开的话可是会缠成一团，到时候整个耳朵都不能要啦。要是愿意让我给你解开的话，我就给你讲故事，怎么样？","id":438},{"type":"charslot","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小塔妮","text":"嗯......好吧......","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#3$1","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"这次要讲，一座山谷里有一颗巨大耀眼的太阳的故事。","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#8$1","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"因为那颗太阳又大又漂亮，所有人都想拥有它。但太阳只有一个，所以大家每天都在吵架、打架，就为了能够拥有这颗太阳。","id":444},{"type":"charslot","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小塔妮","text":"啊，那怎么办？","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小塔妮","text":"奶奶是不是用自己的怀表把山谷里的太阳打成了碎块，变成了散落一地的星星？","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#14$1","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"哈哈......如果奶奶真有那么厉害的话......","id":449},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#1$1","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"......不过，不管过程如何，现在人们的确不再为争抢它而打架了，因为他们现在确实都拥有了美丽的星星。","id":451},{"type":"charslot","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小塔妮","text":"有太阳的山谷......洒满星星的山谷......","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小塔妮","text":"奶奶，真的有那个叫做太阳谷的地方吗？那里真的有这样的美景吗？","id":454},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#1$1","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"当然是真的。等到我的小珊比长大了，也可以自己亲眼去看看呀。","id":456},{"type":"dialog","id":457},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":458},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":459},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":460},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_46_g6_rmbtmine.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":461},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":462},{"type":"charslot","id":463},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":464},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":465},{"type":"text","text":"地下的声音在塔妮的耳中听起来很是嘈杂。脚下有不断滑落的砂石，远处有轰隆作响的机械，前方似乎还有着人们嗡嗡的谈话声。","id":466},{"type":"text","text":"她使劲甩了甩耳朵，想把这一切包括刚刚冒出来的那个疑问都从自己的头脑中甩出去。","id":467},{"type":"text","text":"在意脚下的声音、犹豫前进的方向、总是想故事是真还是假......","id":468},{"type":"text","text":"不不不，那些都已经不重要了！","id":469},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$3","posfrom":"140,-10","posto":"140,-10","focus":"l","id":470},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#1$1","posfrom":"-60,-40","posto":"-60,-40","focus":"l","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"奶奶说的对，“自己亲眼去看”......我会自己去看的！","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我现在要做的事就只有一件，就是把维修员小姐救出去！","id":473},{"type":"dialog","id":474},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":475},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":476},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":477},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_65_g9_warmrabbitnest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":478},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":479},{"type":"charslot","id":480},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":481},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":482},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#6$1","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"不用着急，等你长大了，走在自己的路上，塔妮......","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"你也会在路上找到自己的“怀表”的。","id":485},{"type":"charslot","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小塔妮","text":"我自己的怀表？","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小塔妮","text":"可我想要奶奶的怀表欸。有了奶奶的怀表，就能像奶奶一样厉害，把太阳变成星星了！","id":488},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#1$1","id":489},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"......","id":490},{"type":"charslot","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小塔妮","text":"到底落在了哪里呢？","id":492},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2346_1#7$1","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊娜拉","text":"嗯......落在了哪里呢？可能是大铁屯，可能是太阳谷，可能是南境......","id":494},{"type":"dialog","id":495},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":496},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":497},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":498},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_bg_bg_caveentrance2_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":499},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":500},{"type":"charslot","id":501},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":502},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":503},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3","posfrom":"140,-10","posto":"140,-10","focus":"l","id":504},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#1$1","posfrom":"-60,-40","posto":"-60,-40","focus":"l","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嗯......落在了哪里呢？可能是大铁屯，可能是太阳谷，可能是南境......","id":506},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"嗯......嗯！会找到的，一定会找到的......","id":508},{"type":"dialog","id":509},{"type":"charslot","id":510},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":511},{"type":"dialogue","name":"救援人员的声音","text":"......这里！","id":512},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$3","posfrom":"140,-10","posto":"140,-10","focus":"l","id":513},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#1$1","posfrom":"-60,-40","posto":"-60,-40","focus":"l","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"是其他人的声音？！","id":515},{"type":"dialog","id":516},{"type":"charslot","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"救援人员的声音","text":"......外面！马上就到了！加油！","id":518},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#17$3","posfrom":"140,-10","posto":"140,-10","focus":"l","id":519},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#1$1","posfrom":"-60,-40","posto":"-60,-40","focus":"l","id":520},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"太好了！","id":521},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":522},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"这里、这里是哪里......好亮......","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"伊娜拉......","id":524},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"别、别让我和短耳朵伊娜拉分开......呜呜，我们什么时候能出去......","id":525},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$3","posfrom":"140,-10","posto":"140,-10","focus":"l","id":526},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"呃，哈哈......","id":527},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"啊，我、我看到外面了！再走一步，维修员小姐，再走一步！","id":528},{"type":"dialog","id":529},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":530},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":531},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_breezetree","id":532},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":533},{"type":"charslot","id":534},{"type":"image","image":"76_i04","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.25","yScale":"1.25","x":"-20","y":"-30","fadetime":"0","id":535},{"type":"imagetween","xTo":"20","yTo":"-35","duration":"10","block":"false","id":536},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":537},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":538},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":539,"musicid":5},{"type":"text","text":"一阵裹挟着沙尘的强风刮过，本就在井下弄了一身灰的塔妮一下子更加灰头土脸。","id":540},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"哈——！","id":541},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"天啊，看，维修员小姐！","id":542},{"type":"text","text":"新鲜的空气涌入鼻腔，塔妮忍不住张开嘴猛吸了一口充满太阳气息的空气。","id":543},{"type":"text","text":"身边的人原本因为恐惧而不住颤抖的身体在感受到阳光后慢慢松懈下来。","id":544},{"type":"text","text":"刺目的阳光下，她刚刚认识了没有几天的朋友们关心而又焦急地围在洞口，不知道是该冲上来，还是先让救援人员处理。","id":545},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"呼......","id":546},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"维修员小姐，故事讲完了......我们出来了！","id":547},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我们出来了！","id":548},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"......出来了？","id":549},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"出来了！","id":550},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.25","yScaleFrom":"1.25","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","duration":"15","block":"false","id":551},{"type":"text","text":"塔妮大口呼吸着巷道外新鲜的空气，脑子里忽然又想起那个怀表的事情。","id":552},{"type":"text","text":"如果能像奶奶那样，用怀表打开一条道路，是不是就不必这样狼狈了？","id":553},{"type":"text","text":"也许是的吧。大概是这样没错。","id":554},{"type":"text","text":"但此时此刻的自己，哪怕没有怀表，也把人救了出来，和奶奶做了一样的事情。","id":555},{"type":"text","text":"自己是不是已经有奶奶一半......","id":556},{"type":"text","text":"......四分之一厉害了呢？","id":557},{"type":"dialog","id":558},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":559},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":560},{"type":"image","id":561},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":562},{"type":"charslot","id":563},{"type":"background","id":564},{"type":"image","id":565}],"characters":["严肃的负责人","安洁莉娜","健硕的矿工","阿梅利亚","太阳谷联络员","塔妮","强壮的矿工","嘉辛塔","安洁莉娜的声音","乱糟糟的声音","太阳谷维修员","伊娜拉","“记忆中的短耳朵”","小塔妮","救援人员的声音"]}